[{"w":0.14888888359069824,"text":"USE OF ENGLISH","h":0.011836734693877582,"y":0.071020408128130263,"x":0.026666670379254034},{"x":0.013333334266330361,"w":0.40222221374511713,"text":"7 Complete the text with the correct forms of the","y":0.098775510077857342,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"text":"words in brackets.","y":0.11183673463879817,"w":0.14444443702697757,"x":0.037777780782807538,"h":0.01316326530612244},{"x":0.028888890829250682,"w":0.24444444656372072,"y":0.14244186124432701,"text":"Watch out - a bear!","h":0.015988370934311158},{"x":0.028888889622558481,"y":0.16715116299871258,"w":0.3977777862548828,"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"For years, Kate and I used to go camping by a lake not too"},{"text":"far from where we lived. But last year, we both thought","x":0.028888895974916978,"h":0.013084955020826738,"y":0.17877551004037295,"w":0.38666664123535155},{"h":0.010359515754543969,"y":0.19331395369638704,"text":"we should reconsider (CONSIDER) and go on a journey","w":0.40000000000000002,"x":0.028888893888888774},{"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.20489795932468757,"text":"further afield. We chose to spend a fortnight in a tent in the","x":0.028888890858501454,"w":0.40888889312744142},{"w":0.41999999999999998,"text":"Sequoia National Park, which is famous for its amazing trees","x":0.028888893194444307,"y":0.21947674457581112,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"x":0.028888893352798969,"w":0.10888888359069825,"h":0.0087209296713071094,"y":0.23255813981550921,"text":"and black bears."},{"y":0.24854651179964837,"h":0.011627906487912565,"w":0.41777778625488282,"x":0.028888889872558464,"text":"When we arrived at the campsite, we were warned about an"},{"x":0.14000000117891445,"y":0.26162790741495845,"text":"(USUAL) high number of black bears in the","w":0.30666666030883794,"h":0.011627906487912565},{"text":"area. It was explained to us that the bears are?","w":0.31999998092651372,"y":0.27306122474402894,"x":0.028888896647854344,"h":0.01346938775510198},{"x":0.028888900164478246,"y":0.28775510211616839,"w":0.42222221374511715,"text":"(SENSITIVE) to food smells and that we should hide food in","h":0.010210013876155832},{"x":0.028888896521213282,"y":0.30232558174864876,"h":0.0087209296713071094,"w":0.40666664123535157,"text":"the boot of our car or a metal box on the site. We were also"},{"w":0.13555555343627931,"text":"told not to behave 3","x":0.028888891420749196,"h":0.011627906487912565,"y":0.31250000009906698},{"text":"(RESPONSIBLE) and to","y":0.31540697712171084,"x":0.26444444677967227,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"w":0.17777776718139648},{"text":"avoid certain paths. We didn't take the instructions that","y":0.32693877558797879,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.028888887794108236,"w":0.38222221374511711},{"w":0.40888889312744142,"text":"seriously, but we tried to follow the ranger's advice. For the","x":0.028888890858501454,"y":0.34156976763170677,"h":0.010266966917076847},{"y":0.35465116314406142,"h":0.010246796121402668,"text":"next two weeks everything went smoothly, with no bears in","x":0.028888894290825851,"w":0.41555553436279291},{"h":0.01330710741938379,"x":0.02874316122805853,"w":0.23367580413818356,"y":0.3647609896008468,"text":"sight. We felt safe and it seemed 4"},{"w":0.36222221374511721,"y":0.37918367341137593,"text":"(PROBABLE) that we would come across any bears.","h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.028888893608922855},{"y":0.39387755098789556,"w":0.33333332061767579,"text":"We had a great time hiking and enjoying nature.","h":0.011836734693877693,"x":0.028888899098569388},{"x":0.03111111611111099,"y":0.409795918448564,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.39999999999999997,"text":"However, on the last night, we suddenly heard a bear roar"},{"text":"right outside our tent. At first, I was so shocked that I was","x":0.03111111611111099,"y":0.42285714300172694,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.39999999999999997},{"y":0.43459302321399407,"text":"completely 5","h":0.013162078857421933,"w":0.088888883590698242,"x":0.028888890056502775},{"text":"(CAPABLE) of moving or","y":0.43750000017167778,"x":0.22000000551224766,"w":0.18666666030883791,"h":0.010255102040816255},{"y":0.44897959198692894,"x":0.028888886452609733,"text":"thinking. I wished I had paid more attention to the ranger's","w":0.41111110687255864,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.028888904429714479,"y":0.46366279090568929,"h":0.010214760060213046,"w":0.39555553436279295,"text":"advice about what you're supposed to do in this situation."},{"text":"Then I remembered to throw a jumper in the air and make","x":0.03111113060454624,"y":0.47510204084934882,"w":0.40666664123535162,"h":0.011836734693877582},{"x":0.02888888757188603,"y":0.4883720930738733,"text":"a lot of noise. A ranger heard the bear as well and he came to","w":0.4222222137451172,"h":0.011627906877167304},{"x":0.031111115139982815,"h":0.011836734693877582,"text":"our rescue. It was the most terrifying experience ever.","y":0.50285714298068951,"w":0.36888889312744139},{"x":0.44888888866384152,"w":0.015555555820465083,"y":0.53779069749311481,"h":0.0087209304498166995,"text":"15"},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"8 Choose the correct answers A-D.","y":0.55087209326767161,"x":0.015555566584133479,"w":0.28888887405395508},{"x":0.026666666647364307,"y":0.56976744221376507,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"w":0.033333332538604737,"text":"•0•"},{"y":0.58571428553247218,"x":0.033333343217845764,"w":0.4044444274902344,"h":0.013122923714773971,"text":"According to the National Weather Service, we can expect"},{"text":"severe weather D, with a very dry and hot summer this year.","w":0.4044444274902344,"x":0.031111114532660692,"y":0.60029069760231768,"h":0.013178689917739517},{"h":0.013213099265585115,"w":0.32666664123535155,"text":"Therefore, a number of warnings are being issued.","y":0.61469387766576966,"x":0.033333351493435151},{"w":0.4044444274902344,"x":0.033333346865993825,"y":0.6293604648624922,"h":0.013088514366928483,"text":"First of all, expect southern parts of the country to suffer"},{"text"